	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, your fighting style gained at level 1 improves.</p><p><strong>Akimbo:</strong> You may now add your Dexterity modifier to the damage of off-hand attacks with pistols and revolvers.</p><p><strong>Bullseye:</strong> You critically hit on a 19 or 20 with firearms.</p><p><strong>Saddleshooter:</strong> You can use your bonus action to allow your mount to Dash.</p><p><strong>Sharpshooter:</strong> Your range with firearms increases by another 20ft on each range increment, and you gain expertise on stealth checks.</p><p><strong>Shotgunner:</strong> You may ignore the loading property of shotguns.</p><p><strong>Sword and Shot:</strong> If you are wielding a melee weapon in one hand you may disengage as a bonus action.</p><p><strong>Trickshooter:</strong> When you use a basic maneuver with a firearm, you deal the firearm’s normal damage rather than basic ranged damage.</p>",
